<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wafi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Wafilipi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wafilipi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ayandikili lihamba kwa wakwinila wa Filipi kumachuwa gha isitini na monga badili gha kuweka kwa Kilisito, ayandikili lipindi awelili mukihungo kusula gha 1:13, na inguwesekani lipindi anguyandika lihamba hali awelili ku Loma. Lihamba liyandikilwi kulipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wa haku mbwani wa Filipi. Tungujivula mayaghani kwa habali gha mbwani wa Filipi kuhuma kukihitabu kya matendu gha wandumindumi. Filipi uwelili mmbwani mkulu wa mlima wa Makidonia. mbwani hau uwelili na lipinga lya wamdu wamkwinila Kilisito lya mtumbulo ku haku Makidonia. Paulo na Sila watumbulili kwa pamonga lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito na lipindi wawelili haku uhiku wakavikwa mukihungo kihitabu kya Matendu sula gha 16</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo awelili na lukani wekaweka lipindi awelili anguyandika lihamba hali. Akatumila fwasi hai kushukwile lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito kwa hupo wampeghili badili gha kuhyoghanila yiwa kawela mukihungo kusula gha 4:10-19. Akaghola maheli lipindi awelili mukihungo na akawalongela Timoseo na Epafulodito wayendi kulipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito kusula gha 2:19-30, kwa nagha wangupalwa wawapokeli na kuwatundamila wawamanyi handa vilongosi waweni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula lihamba kwa kujambusa lipinga lya wandu wakwinila Kilisito lya haku Filipi kusula gha 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu anguwalongela habali zyaki apatili lipindi hali na mayaghani awelili nazu kusula gha 1:3-2:30</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akayegha yala matendu wakilisito wangupalwa kughola kusula gha 3:1-4:30</para>
  <para style="io">Mwihu Paulo anguyomola kwa kuwajambusa na kuwashukwile lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya haku Filipi kwa hupo kusula gha 4:10-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Nenga Paulo na Timoseo, watumikila wa Yesu Kilisito,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">tunguwayandikila mwenga wandu wa Sapanga haku kumlima wa Filipi weni kukonganiswa na Kilisito Yesu, pamonga na vilongosi na weni kuwatanga vilongosi pamonga na wakwinila.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Ningumyupa Sapanga umaha na kulikala kwa kuponga kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga, na kwa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angumshukwile Sapanga kwa wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito wa Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Kila paninguwakumbwike, ningumshukwile Sapanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Kumayupu ghangu machuwa hyogha niwelili nikiwayupila mwenga wogha kwa luheku, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />hai ni kwaikiva gha kunitanga kutangasa Habali Maha kuhuma lichuwa lila lya mtumbulo mbaka hinaa. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Nenga ningumanya yiwa Sapanga ndiwa mweni kutumbulisa lihengu hali maha, ningumanya yiwa kanguwesa ng'ogha kusindwa kuyomola lihengu hali mpaka lichuwa lya kuhika Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Ningupalwa kuwawachilila mwenga kwaikiva ninguwapala nesu, Sapanga katuwesesa kughola lihengu lyaki pamonga, paikawela niwopwa mgelesa au ikiwela ningulongela wandu yiwa kwa kyani Habali maha ni ujumbi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Sapanga mweni angulola vila niwela na luhujulu lwa kuwalola mwenga. Ninguwapala mwenga wogha kwa upalo hula wa Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ninguyupa kwa Sapanga yiwa upalo wa mwenga uyendeleli kuyongeseka na muweli na luhala pamonga na malangu, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />lukani mpati kumanya ghala gha maha mkaweli mngujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga, wandu weni kuwela ng'ogha na mahakata mbaka lichuwa paatehika Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Ngalilu gha mwenga imemi matendu matangala gha maha mpatili kwa Kilisito Yesu, ili mumpeghi Sapanga ukulu na kusifilwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulama ni Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Walongu wa nenga ningupala mmanyi yiwa mighalu hila inikolile ndiwa itangili kulandala kwa Habali Maha. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Watovangondo wogha wa kulighuta lya nkosi na wandu waghangi wogha wangumanya nivikwa mkihungu kwaikiva gha kughola lihengu lya Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Hinu kukovekelana na hagha, kuwopwa kwa nenga kukawaghola wandu weni kummkwinila Bambu waweli na makakala nesu gha kutangasa Habali Maha bila holu.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ingumanyika yiwa wandu waghangi wangutangasa ujumbi wa Kilisito kwaikiva wawela na wifu na kusindana, na waghangi wangutangasa Habali gha Kilisito kwa lukani maha, <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />amonga gha wandu hagha wangughola nagha kwa upalo wakimanya yiwa Sapanga kanipegha lihengu hali lya kuwalongela wandu yiwa Habali Maha ni ujumbi wa chakaka wa Sapanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />amonga kwa mbandi ighangi wangutangasa Habali Maha kwa kusindana ili weni waweli wakolamlima wala ng'ogha kwa lukani maha, wanguwachila yiwa wangunivika mmaghaso kwa kunitaya nenga mkihungu.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Hata nagha, nenga ingunighasa ng'ogha, paikawela wangumtangasa Kilisito kwa njila gha uhakata au umaha. Ila nenga paikawela Kilisito angutangaswa ninguhekelela, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Kwaikiva ningumanya yiwa kwa mayupo gha mwenga na kwa mtanga hula weni kuyeghwa na Mpumulo wa Yesu Kilisito, ghala yanikolile nenga yateghalambuswa na hinu nitelekeselwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Nimemwa na litumaini yiwa kwahela mighalu yenikunighola niweli na holu kwa njila yeyosi hila. Niwela na uhighilisu niteyendelela kuwela na makakala gha kutangasa Habali Maha kwa upekesu handa vila niwela. Na Kilisito atesifilwa kwa havi ningughola kumhigha ghangu, iweli nitelama au kuhwegha. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Kwa nenga, ngalilu ghangu hyogha ni kumgholela lihengu Kilisito, na kuhwegha ni maha kupiti kuyendelela kulama. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Handa niteyendelela kulama haku kumlima wogha niteyendelela kumgholela mahengu Bambu. Ila paghati gha kuhova na kulama, manya ng'ogha niki nihaghuli. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Ningukweghwa na mighalu miivili, ningupala kuyenda nikalikali pamonga na Kilisito, kwaikiva havi ni maheli nesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Ila ni maha nesu kwaikiva gha mwenga nenga niyendelela kulama. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ila ningumanya yiwa mwenga wogha mngupala niyendeleli kuwela na mwenga, nenga ningumanya yiwa niteyendelela kulama na niteyendelela kulikala na mwenga ili niwatangi mwenga muyendeleli kukula na kuhekelelela kukukwinila muwela naku, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />ili panitewela pamonga na mwenga kangi, mtewela na mghalu wa kuitutumulila kwa ghala Yesu Kilisito kayaghola kupitila nenga.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Hinu ndyangilu gha mwenga, na iweli handa ingupala Habali Maha gha Kilisito, ili panitehika au nihiki ng'ogha. Nihyoghanili yiwa mgholoka maha kumpumulo mmonga na moyu mmonga. Ili kuwatanga waghangi wakwinili Habali Maha gha Kilisito, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />mkotoho kuwatila wala weni kuwangingama. Kukotoho kutila kwa mwenga na kugholoka kukukwinila ndiwa kilangihi kya kuyalamika kwa weni, ila mwenga mtelokolwa, na hali ni lihengu lya Sapanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Sapanga kawapegha mwenga umaha wa kumtumikila Kilisito, ng'ogha kwa kumkwinila hela, ila hilahila kwa kuhakilwa kwaikiva gha mweni. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Mngukonganika pamonga na nenga kungondu, hilahila muilolile nikiwela nayu, hata hinaa ningukimbanika.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuwela handa Kilisito vila kawela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Kilisito awatayi moyu, mapalo ghaki yawatayi makakala, Mpumulo wa Sapanga awagholi muweli kindu kimonga, na muweli na luhungu kwa waghangi, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />mtimilisi luheku lwa nenga kwa kuwela na mawachilo mamonga, upalo mmonga na moyu mmonga na mawachilo gha mwenga yajumilani. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ukotoho kuiwachila yiwa wenga wa maha kupiti wayako. Badili ghaki uweli mnyenyekela ukiwalola wayako wamaha kupiti wenga. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kila mmonga akotoho kuwachila mighalu anguipala mweni weka, badili ghaki awachili mighalu yeni kupalwa na waghangi. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mngupalwa muwachili mighalu handa vila Kilisito Yesu kawesa kuwachila,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Kiuchakaka Kilisito awelili Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">Ila kakanila kulangiha ulungu ghaki,<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />badili ghaki kwa kupala mweni akaleka kila kindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">akaleka ukulu, na kuwela handa muhusutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">akaweleka handa mundu .<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Pakawela na mhigha hau wa kimundu anyenyekelili, akajumila kuhova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">kangi kihu kya kuvambwa kulipingika.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Kukovekelana na hali Sapanga akamyinula na kuwela mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">kupiti waghangi wogha.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Kwa utundamilu wa Yesu vindu vyogha vya kunani na pahi pamhanga vimtundamili Yesu,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />na kila mundu ajumili yiwa Yesu Kilisito ni Bambu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">kwa ukulu wa Sapanga Tati wa twenga.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tung'anyimi kumlimawogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Wapalwa wa nenga kukovekelana na hagha handa vila msowelela kuyitikila machuwa hyogha, handa vila myitikilile paniwelile na mwenga, muyendeleli kuyitikila paniwela ng'ogha, mulangihi kwa matendu ulokola wa mwenga kwa kutila na kuhihimila, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />kwaikiva Sapanga ndiwa mweni kughola lihengu mghati mwa mwenga, na kuwapegha moyu wa kupala na kutimilisa lukani lwaki maha.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Mgholi mighalu hyogha bila mang'ung'uliku au masindano, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />ili muweli wana wa Sapanga weni kuwela ng'ogha na kung'ung'ulikilwa, wala mahakata, wala weni kuwela ng'ogha na mahakata wenikulikala kukiweleka haki kyeni kubyodoka. Mng'anyimi paghati gha weni handa ndondwa vila zingulangasila kunani, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />mkiwalongela wandu Lilando lya Sapanga lyeni kuwapegha wandu Ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Ndiwa na nenga niteilola yiwa mnipegha utundamilo lichuwa lila atehika Kilisito, kwaikiva itelangiha lipala yiwa kuyangala kwa nenga na lihengu lya nenga viyaghamila ng'ogha yaghi.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Pamonga na yiwa nitehova na mwahi ghangu utetolwa handa litambiko lya kunywegha pamonga na litambiko lya ukwinila wa mwenga kwa Sapanga, hinu ninguhekelela nesu na kangi ninguhekelela pamonga na mwenga wogha. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Vilavila, na mwenga inguwapala mhekeleli na kululuta pamonga na nenga,<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoseo na Epafulodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Niwela na lituini kwa Bambu Yesu kumyegha Timoteseo kwa twenga njenji, ili anitayi moyu panitepokela ujumbi wa mwenga. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nahela mundu mghangi mweni kuwesa kuwagholokela maha kwa moyu ghaki wogha handa mweni. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Waghangi wangukimbanikila hela mighalu ghao wenibaha badili gha kukimbanikila mighalu gha Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Mwenga maweni mngumanya vila Timoseo kalangiha kwa mwenga, kwaikiva kaghola lihengu lya Habali Maha pamonga na nenga handa mwana vila angughola lihengu kwa tati ghaki. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Hinu, nitemlaghila kwa mwenga njenji pala panitemanya mighalu ghangu vila itewela. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nenga mwenibaha niwela na litumaini yiwa Bambu Yesu ateniwesesa nihiki kuwalola njenji.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Ila ninguliwachila ni mbaha kumyegha kangi kwa mwenga Epafulodito, mlongu ghangu na mghola lihengu pamonga na nenga, mtovangondo myangu, kangi ni mjumbi wa mwenga mumyeghili kwa nenga anitangi. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Mweni kana luhujulu nesu lwa kuwalola mwenga wogha, na awelili na holu nesu kwaikiva amanyili yiwa mwenga mhyoghanilile awelili anguvina, <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />kiuchakaka awelili mvina pabehi na kuhova, ila Sapanga akamuwonela luhungu, ili alami na nikotoho kuwela na mnyengemalu kangi mkihungu kyangu. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Hinu ningupala nesu kumyegha kwa mwenga, ili pamumlola mpati kuhekelela kangi, na mnyengemalu niwela nau uhuki. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Mumpokeli kwa kulangiha mapalo, mweni handa mlongu kulihengu lya Bambu, mngupalwa kulangiha utundamilu kwa wandu handa mweni, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />amanyili yiwa angalihova kwaikiva gha kunitanga nenga mweni akapala kuhova kwaikiva gha lihengu lya Kilisito kwa kunitanga nenga pala mwenga msindwa kuulangiha mtanga kwa nenga.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Kujumilwa na Sapanga kwa uchakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Kumwihu walongu ghangu, mhekeleli kwa kukongana na Bambu! Nenga nitoka ng'ogha kuhuyila kuyandika mighalu hilahila niwayandikilile haku kuhyetu, ila ni kwaikiva gha kuwatanga. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Mkali mihu na wavula weni kuwalasimisa wakwinila wogha wayingiswi jandu, weni ni handa waghalu wakalipa, hinu mlikali kutali na weni kwaikiva hali wanguwalasimisa ni uhakata. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Wandu weni kuyingiswa jandu kiuchakaka ni twenga, ng'ogha weni, kwaikiva tungumyupa Sapanga kwa ulongosi wa Mpumulo ghaki na tungulitutumula kwaikiva tukongine na Yesu. Kangi tunguvika ng'ogha litumaini kumighalu gha kihigha, <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ila paikawela kuwela na mundu kanguilola yiwa kana matendu gha kutumainila mhigha, nenga niwela na matangala nesu gha kutumainila kupiti mweni. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nenga niyingisilwi jandu lichuwa lya inane, nenga ni mundu wa Izilaeli wa likabila lya Benjamini, nenga ni Mwibulania wa kuwelekwa. Kwa mighalu gha laghilo ni niwelile Mfalisayo, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />niyangalalili nesu kughola mighalu hila ningulola Sapanga anguipala, hata nikalihakila lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito. Nigholile kila kindu kiwelile kikipalwa na laghilo ili kujumilwa na Sapanga, nenga niwela ng'ogha na uhakata. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Lipindi liteni mighalu hai niilolile yiwa ni ghamaha nesu kwa nenga, ila hinaa kwaikiva gha Kilisito ninguilola yiwa ghamaha ng'ogha kwa nenga. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />kangi ng'ogha hagha weka, ila ningulola yiwa kila kindu kya maha ng'ogha, kwaikiva gha umaheli wa kummanya Kilisito Yesu Bambu wa nenga, kwaikiva gha mweni kutaghilila kutali kila kindu, nikalola hagha hyogha ni ndaka, ili nimpati Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />Hilahila nikonganiswa nayu, nileka kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa kupitila laghilo apeghilwi Musa. Sapanga kanijumila nenga kwaikiva gha kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Ningupala kummanya Kilisito na uwesa wa kuhinduka kwaki na kukonganika kumahakilo ghaki na kuwela handa mweni kukihu kyaki, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />nikiwela na litumaini yiwa na nenga nitehinduliwa hilahila.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyangala kuhikila lukani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ningulonga ng'ogha yiwa nihika kala mahala haku kungalilu ghangu. Nitimila ng'ogha kuwela handa vila Sapanga anguipala niweli. Ila ninguyangala kuhikila mahala haku. Hali luwelili lukani lwa Kilisito kuhuma pala anihaghulile. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Walongu ghangu, ninguliwachila ng'ogha yiwa nipata kala hupo hai. Ila ningughola mghalu mmonga. Ninguisemwa mighalu hila gha dahile, nikiyangala kuyayendela lula lukani. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Hinu, ninguyangala kuhikila lukani lya nenga ili kumwihu mbati hila hupo, na hupo yeni ni kukemwa na Sapanga haku kundumba kwa njila gha Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Twenga wogha weni kukamala kukukwinila tungupalwa kuwachila mghalu hauhau. Ila handa wamonga wa mwemga wanguwachila mghalu mghangi, hinu Sapanga ateuvika paluagha mghalu hau. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Ila tungupalwa kuyendelela kuikovekela chakaka tuwelanayu kala.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Walongu ghangu, mkovekeli mlandano wa nenga na kuwalola wala weni kukovekela ndyangilu tuwalangisili. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Nilongela kala mghalu hau mianja itangala, na hinaa ninguhuyila kulongela kunu nikilila. Wandu watangala wangungingama mavulo gha Yesu kuhova kulipingika. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Mwihu wa weni ni kuyalamila, kwaikiva wanguyupa kila wangukihakula, wangulitutumula kwa kughola mighalu yeni kuwapughanisa na mawachilo ghao wanguwachila mighalu gha mlima wogha hau. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Twenga twa wenikaya wa kundumba, kuhuma haku kundumba tungumtumainila mlokola wa twenga Bambu Yesu Kilisito ahiki kuhuma kundumba. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Mweni ateghalambusa mihigha gha twenga gha kuhakala na kuighola ilandine na higha ghaki yeni ukulu, kwa uwesa hula weni kuwesesa vindu vyogha vilongoswi na mweni.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Malaghilo wekaweka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Hinu walongu wa nenga, wandu ninguwapala, niwela na luhujulu na mwenga lwa kuwalola, mwenga weni kunighola nihekeleli, mwenga ndiwa wandu weni kunighola nipeghwi hupo, mwenga wapalwa wa nenga mngupalwa mgangamali kukukonganika na Bambu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ninguwaluwa nesu Eudia na Sinitike, mgholi ndulumu handa walongu weni kukongana na Bambu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Ningukuluwa mtumikila myangu mchakaka, uwatangi wadala hagha, kwaikiva waghasikili nesu pamonga na nenga kulihengu lya kutangasa Habali Maha kwa kuyangala, pamonga na Kilementi na wayangu waghangi hagha wogha mahina ghao yayandikwa kukihitabu kya ukomu.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Hinu mhekeleli machuwa hyogha kwa kukongine na Bambu! Ninguhuyila kangi kulongela, mhekileli.<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Kila mundu awonesi unyalinyali wa mwenga. Bambu kapabehi kuhika. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Mkotoho kughasika kukindu chochosi , ila kuhyogha muweli wandu wa kumyupa na kumshukwile Sapanga kwa kila mngukipala, machuwa hyogha myupi mkiwela na moyu wa kushukwile. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Kuponga gha Sapanga ipitili malanga hyogha gha wandu itegholokela maheli mioyu na malanga gha mwenga kukukongana na Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Kwa kuhyomolela, walongo wa nenga, muviki mawachilo gha mwenga kumighalu hyogha yenikuwela gha chakaka na yeni kutundamilisa na yeni kupalwa na Sapanga na maha na gha kuhekelesa na hyogha yeni kuwayeghela sifwa gha maha. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Myendeleli kughola ghala mlivula na kupokela kuhuma kwa nenga, na hyogha mhyoghanilile na kulola vila niwela nikighola. Na Sapanga mweni kuwaghola mlikali kwa kuponga atewela pamonga na mwenga.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angushukwile kwaikiva gha hupo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Nihekelela nesu na kumshukwile Sapanga. Kiuchakaka machuwa hyogha muwelili mnguniwachila nesu kunitanga, ila msindilwi njila gha kuyegha mtanga kwa nenga. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ningulonga ng'ogha nagha kwaikiva ningupala mtanga kuhuma kwa yeyosi, nenga nilivula kukwila na kila niwela nachu. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ningumanya ndambu gha kulama paniwela ng'ogha na hindu, na hilahila paniwela na hindu ngenju. Nilivulili mighalu hyogha kuwela na njala au kuyukuta, kuwela na hindu ngenyu au kulepelelwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Kilisito angunipegha makakala gha kusinda mighalu hai hyogha.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ila mwenga mghola maha kwa kukonganika pamonga na nenga kwa kunitanga kulung'ai lwangu. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Nyongesa gha hagha, mwenga Wafilipi mngumanya yiwa lichuwa lya mtumbulo panitumbula lihengu lya kutangasa Habali Maha, paniwelile nikihuka haku Makedonia, kwahela lipinga lighangi lya weni kumkwinila Kilisito lyeni kutangana na nenga kunani gha kupegha na kupokela, ila mwenga maweni hela. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Hata paniwelile haku Tesaloniki mnitangili mihanja itangala. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ninguhakula ng'ogha kupokela hindu kuhuma kwa mwenga ila ningupala kulola highili kuhuma kwa Sapanga zikiwahikila mwenga kwa hagha mnguyaghola kwa upalo. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Hinu, nipokela kala vindu vyogha mnipeghili hupo zitangala nesu. Niwela na kila kindu kwa vila hinaa Epafulodito kaniyeghela kala hupo zya mwenga. Hupo hazi ni handa litambiko lyeni kulunguswa lyeni manungilo maheli, na hali ni litambiko lyeni kujumilwa na kumhekelesa Sapanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Hinu, Sapanga wa nenga, kwa unaisa ghaki mkulu kwa njila gha Kilisito, atewapegha vindu vyogha mnguvipala. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Sapanga wa twenga hayu Tati wa twenga asifilwe machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Hina.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando gha kuhyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Nijambusili wandu wogha weni kukongana na Kilisito Yesu, walongo wenikuwela pamonga na nenga wanguwajambusa. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Kangi wandu wogha wa Sapanga wenikuwela baha, wanguwajambusa, nesu nesu wandu weni kumkwinila Sapanga wala weni kuwela kulighuta lya Kaisali nkosi wa Loma.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Ningumluwa Sambanga Tati awapeghi umaha kuhuma kwa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>